{"unit_id":"tag:02Z7:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>是特征（characteristic）为零的域（field）。\n设<MATH_0002>，并设<MATH_0003>。\n我们取<MATH_0004>为作用（action），即<MATH_0005>通过平移作用于仿射（affine）直线。\n唯一的不动点（fixed point）是泛点（generic point），而且<MATH_0006>显然嵌入域（field）<MATH_0007>的自同构群（automorphism group）。（这里用到了特征（characteristic）为零的假设。）\n考虑仿射（affine）直线的泛点（generic point）到商（quotient）的态射（morphism）\n<MATH_0008>。\n我们断言，此态射（morphism）不能通过任何从一个域（field）的谱（spectrum）到<MATH_0010>的单态射（monomorphism）<MATH_0009>分解。（这与概形（schemes）的情形相反，见《概形（Schemes）》第<REF_0001>节。）事实上，由于<MATH_0011>没有任何非平凡有限（finite）子群（subgroups），由引理<REF_0002>可知，对任何这样的分解都有<MATH_0012>。最后，<MATH_0013>不是单态射（monomorphism），因为\n<MATH_0014>\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"characteristic","target_term":"特征"},{"source_term":"field","target_term":"域"},{"source_term":"action","target_term":"作用"},{"source_term":"affine","target_term":"仿射"},{"source_term":"fixed point","target_term":"不动点"},{"source_term":"generic point","target_term":"泛点"},{"source_term":"field","target_term":"域"},{"source_term":"automorphism group","target_term":"自同构群"},{"source_term":"characteristic","target_term":"特征"},{"source_term":"affine","target_term":"仿射"},{"source_term":"generic point","target_term":"泛点"},{"source_term":"quotient","target_term":"商"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"field","target_term":"域"},{"source_term":"spectrum","target_term":"谱"},{"source_term":"monomorphism","target_term":"单态射"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"Schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"subgroups","target_term":"子群"},{"source_term":"monomorphism","target_term":"单态射"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"characteristic","target_term":"特征","context":"域的特征为零；当前包无批准词条。"},{"source_term":"field","target_term":"域","context":"定义仿射直线的基域和函数域；当前包无批准词条。"},{"source_term":"action","target_term":"作用","context":"整数群通过平移作用于仿射直线。"},{"source_term":"affine","target_term":"仿射","context":"仿射直线；当前包无批准词条。"},{"source_term":"fixed point","target_term":"不动点","context":"平移作用唯一固定的点。"},{"source_term":"generic point","target_term":"泛点","context":"仿射直线的泛点。"},{"source_term":"automorphism group","target_term":"自同构群","context":"函数域的自同构群。"},{"source_term":"quotient","target_term":"商","context":"仿射直线对整数群作用的商。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"泛点到商的态射。"},{"source_term":"spectrum","target_term":"谱","context":"域的谱。"},{"source_term":"monomorphism","target_term":"单态射","context":"域的谱到商的单态射。"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"与概形情形比较。"},{"source_term":"Schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"所引用章节的名称。"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限","context":"整数群的有限子群。"},{"source_term":"subgroups","target_term":"子群","context":"整数群的非平凡子群。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:02Z0:prose-0007","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n这个例子表明，为了定义代数空间（algebraic space）<MATH_0001>的点，我们应考虑从域（fields）的谱（spectra）到<MATH_0002>的态射（morphisms）的等价类（equivalence classes），而不是从域（fields）的谱（spectra）出发的单态射（monomorphisms）的集合（set）。\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n最后，我们给出一个确实很糟糕的例子。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"fields","target_term":"域"},{"source_term":"spectra","target_term":"谱"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"equivalence classes","target_term":"等价类"},{"source_term":"fields","target_term":"域"},{"source_term":"spectra","target_term":"谱"},{"source_term":"monomorphisms","target_term":"单态射"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间","context":"通过来自域的谱的态射定义代数空间的点。"},{"source_term":"fields","target_term":"域","context":"考虑域的谱；当前包无批准词条。"},{"source_term":"spectra","target_term":"谱","context":"域的谱。"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"从域的谱到代数空间的态射。"},{"source_term":"equivalence classes","target_term":"等价类","context":"这些态射的等价类。"},{"source_term":"monomorphisms","target_term":"单态射","context":"从域的谱出发的单态射。"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合","context":"单态射的集合。"}],"notes":[]}
